  "notes": "手册中的序列示例，最终序列及立即数由汇编器、目标地址和重定位决定，不在此生成机器码。ra 表示链接寄存器 x1 或 x5；语义直接调用的地址必须来自目标符号的 PC 相对或绝对偏移。",
  "notesEn": "Manual sequence examples only: the assembler, target and relocations determine the final sequence and immediates. No machine code is generated here. ra denotes link register x1 or x5; a semantically direct call must derive its address from a PC-relative or absolute symbol offset.",
  "expansions": [
    {
      "syntax": "call offset",
      "condition": "PC 相对地址示例",
      "conditionEn": "PC-relative address example",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "auipc",
          "assembly": "auipc ra, imm20"
        },
        {
          "name": "jalr",
          "assembly": "jalr ra, imm12(ra)"
        }
      ],
      "clobbers": [
        "ra"
      ]
    },
